cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Seizure Onset Consensus
abstract: Fuses the channel rankings of seizure-onset localisation methods (DynaSD channel recruitment,
  Epileptogenicity Index, neural fragility) into one seizure-onset-zone estimate per SEEG/ECoG recording,
  and scores every method and the consensus against expert onset labels (AUC, precision/recall/F1,
  SzCORE event scoring of the detected onset).
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-seizure-consensus
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- electrophysiology
- epilepsy
- seizure-onset
- consensus
- statistics
